+### RV-2 MED (prod too): inbound header parsers and uncapped headers
+**Linear parsers.** Pure, in `src/lib/core/inbound-address.ts`, each equal to the old regex on every input:
+- `trailingAngleAddr` ≡ `/<([^>]*)>\s*$/`
+- `firstAngleAddr` ≡ `/<([^>]+)>/`
